#: ../../library/re.rst:1749
msgid ""
"For a match *m*, return the 2-tuple ``(m.start(group), m.end(group))``. "
"Note that if *group* did not contribute to the match, this is ``(-1, "
"-1)``. *group* defaults to zero, the entire match."
